  "body": "Set privately back from the road, on an elevated site, this substantial Glendowie residence delivers the space, security and versatility that busy family life demands.\r\n\r\nDesigned and built by the current owners in 2003, and meticulously maintained ever since, this much-loved freehold home has been enjoyed for more than 20 years and thoughtfully designed to grow with a family, from the early years through to teenagers and beyond.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is an impressively large open-plan kitchen, an entertainer’s dream with generous proportions and effortless connection to the dining and casual living areas. Bi-fold doors extend the living outdoors to secure, landscaped courtyards and wraparound spaces, creating an easy flow for entertaining, children and relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nA separate formal lounge with gas fire provides a warm retreat for cosy evenings, while a guest powder room and generous separate laundry complete the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the sense of scale continues. The oversized master suite features a walk-in wardrobe and spacious ensuite, while three further generous double bedrooms, all with excellent wardrobe space, are serviced by a large family bathroom complete with bath.\r\n\r\nThe entrance and striking central atrium enhance the feeling of light and openness across both levels, giving the home an impressive sense of space throughout.\r\n\r\nPrivate, secure and wonderfully practical, this is also an exceptional lock-up-and-leave proposition, with a large internal-access double garage, excellent off-street parking for family and visitors, and an abundance of storage.\r\nExtra touches make everyday living even more enjoyable, including a built-in movie projector and screen, laundry chute from the upstairs bathroom, and an outdoor spa for relaxing at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nClose to an excellent selection of public and private schools, within easy walking distance to both Glendowie College and Sacred Heart College, moments from St Heliers Bay, waterfront beaches and all that the Eastern Bays lifestyle has to offer, this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial, beautifully maintained family home where space, privacy and effortless living come together.",
